# Diabetes Universe — environment contract
#
# No environment variables are currently required to run the application locally
# or in production. The web app boots without runtime secrets.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Future public variables (client-safe)
# Uncomment and set only when a feature explicitly requires them.
# Public variables are embedded in the client bundle — never place secrets here.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Future server-only variables
# Use for secrets and backend configuration. Never prefix secrets with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
#
# DATABASE_URL=
# API_SECRET=
